  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/heritage.svg
  Description: Your past incarnations dwelled in the caves on the snowcapped mountains
    of Tian Xia, so your body has become adept at surviving frigid storms. You gain
    cold resistance equal to half your level (minimum 1). You treat environmental
    cold effects as if they were one step less extreme (incredible cold becomes extreme,
    extreme cold becomes severe, and so on).
